hted conformance scores.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: DET note says it 'nailed the high-leverage moves' while PULL_UP was +10.2pp over the recommendation.\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.093, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.37 p=0.0261 n=25.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-014"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-055", "score": 0.084, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-055 | Study family SF-APPA-055: All play types x Q1-Q4 gradient on 30 stars\n- observed_research_question: All play types x Q1-Q4 gradient on 30 stars\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Only PUTBACK shows a fatigue signature (near-zero Q1 suppression compounding to Q4) across the full 30-star panel.\n- observed_result: PUTBACK Q1 d=-0.001 to Q4 d=-0.233, Q1->Q4 -0.232 (Q1 poss 722 / Q4 531). Other PTs suppress in Q1 already; largest other gradient DRIVE -0.060. CUT reverses +0.020. TRANSITION -0.053.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- observed_failure_evidence: On the full 30-star weighted panel, only PUTBACK is near-zero in Q1 and heavy in Q4.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars; PUTBACK Q4 n=531 poss\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-054\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-054\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-056"}], "n_results": 4}

